{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22064","headline":"新乐府 百链镜\t辨皇王鉴也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 百链镜\t辨皇王鉴也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百链镜，熔范非常规，日辰处所灵且只。\n江心波上舟中铸，五月五日日午时。\n琼粉金膏磨莹已，化爲一片秋潭水。\n镜成将献蓬莱宫，扬州长吏手自封。\n人间臣妾不合照，背有九五飞天龙。\n人人呼爲天子镜，我有一言闻太宗。\n太宗常以人爲镜，鉴古鉴今不鉴容。\n四海安危居掌内，百王治乱悬心中。\n乃知天子别有镜，不是扬州百链铜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}